devicetree/sm8550
Kernel modules and device tree sources for the OnePlus 11 (Qualcomm SM8550,
OPPO project 22811). Used as a submodule of android_kernel_oneplus_sm8550, whose
scripts/setup-tree.sh links vendor/ and oplus/ to the files in this repository.

1. UPSTREAM

   Repo:    https://github.com/OnePlusOSS/android_kernel_modules_and_devicetree_oneplus_sm8550
   Branch:  oneplus/sm8550_b_16.0.0_oneplus_11
   Fork point: 46a66233
     Synchronize code for OnePlus CPH2447_16.0.5.1301(EX01)
     CPH2449_16.0.5.1301(EX01) CPH2451_16.0.5.1301(EX01)
     PHB110_16.0.5.1301(CN01)
     Based on QCOM release TAG:
     AU_LINUX_KERNEL.PLATFORM.2.0.R1.00.00.00.004.146

   Content: vendor/ holds the OPPO and Qualcomm drivers, including the oplus
   charger subsystem. kernel_platform/ holds the device tree sources.

2. CHANGES IN THIS FORK

   Branch feat/16.0/oneplus_11/pps, two commits on top of the fork point:
     4d11ef49  enable third-party PPS for 22811 and add 11V/5A strategy data
     2a79fb5a  make the v1 PPS engine work without a charge pump

   Five driver files and one dtsi are touched. Details are in SUPPORT.md in the
   parent repository.

